        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 318.163,
        "x1": 355.551,
        "bottom": 325.163
      },
      "reading_order": 45,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0046",
      "text": "Versand im Werk kontrolliert und geprüft, um eine sichere Lieferung",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 323.782,
        "x1": 188.797,
        "bottom": 330.782
      },
      "reading_order": 46,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0047",
      "text": "sein, einen großen Durchmesser haben und unter Vakuum nicht",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 326.563,
        "x1": 363.552,
        "bottom": 333.563
      },
      "reading_order": 47,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0048",
      "text": "und einen zufriedenstellenden Service zu gewährleisten.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 332.182,
        "x1": 161.946,
        "bottom": 339.182
      },
      "reading_order": 48,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0049",
      "text": "schrumpfen.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 334.963,
        "x1": 237.891,
        "bottom": 341.963
      },
      "reading_order": 49,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0050",
      "text": "Nach dem Erhalt der Pumpe empfiehlt es sich, wie folgt",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 343.462,
        "x1": 162.112,
        "bottom": 350.462
      },
      "reading_order": 50,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0051",
      "text": "Bevor Sie die Pumpe in Betrieb nehmen, wenden Sie sich im",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 346.243,
        "x1": 354.887,
        "bottom": 353.243
      },
      "reading_order": 51,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0052",
      "text": "vorzugehen:",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 351.862,
        "x1": 57.807,
        "bottom": 358.861
      },
      "reading_order": 52,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0053",
      "text": "Zweifelsfall an Ihren Lieferanten.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 354.643,
        "x1": 286.442,
        "bottom": 361.643
      },
      "reading_order": 53,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0054",
      "text": "a. Entfernen Sie das Verpackungsmaterial aus dem Behälter und",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 364.762,
        "x1": 186.856,
        "bottom": 371.762
      },
      "reading_order": 54,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0055",
      "text": "überprüfen Sie den Inhalt.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 373.161,
        "x1": 100.568,
        "bottom": 380.161
      },
      "reading_order": 55,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0056",
      "text": "ACHTUNG",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 375.933,
        "x1": 265.023,
        "bottom": 382.933
      },
      "reading_order": 56,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0057",
      "text": "Leichte Erdölderivate, Verdünner, Lösungsmittel",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 384.333,
        "x1": 355.937,
        "bottom": 391.333
      },
      "reading_order": 57,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0058",
      "text": "b. Untersuchen Sie die Pumpe auf mögliche Transportschäden.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 384.442,
        "x1": 183.096,
        "bottom": 391.442
      },
      "reading_order": 58,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0059",
      "text": "sowie hochkonzentrierte oder organische Säuren",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 392.733,
        "x1": 357.918,
        "bottom": 399.733
      },
      "reading_order": 59,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0060",
      "text": "Wenn ein Teil fehlt oder beschädigt ist, melden Sie dies sofort",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 392.841,
        "x1": 186.106,
        "bottom": 399.841
      },
      "reading_order": 60,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0061",
      "text": "dürfen nicht gepumpt werden. Zur Verlängerung der",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 401.134,
        "x1": 368.048,
        "bottom": 408.134
      },
      "reading_order": 61,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0062",
      "text": "dem Spediteur und dem Lieferanten.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 401.241,
        "x1": 126.564,
        "bottom": 408.241
      },
      "reading_order": 62,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0063",
      "text": "Lebensdauer der Pumpe können Sie sie",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 409.534,
        "x1": 333.496,
        "bottom": 416.534
      },
      "reading_order": 63,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0064",
      "text": "c. Beim Auspacken schwerer Gegenstände ist ggf. Hebezeug",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 412.522,
        "x1": 177.496,
        "bottom": 419.522
      },
      "reading_order": 64,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0065",
      "text": "am Ende des Arbeitstages mit Wasser oder Neutralis-",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 417.933,
        "x1": 368.124,
        "bottom": 424.933
      },
      "reading_order": 65,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0066",
      "text": "zu verwenden. Siehe dazu das Datenblatt für Gewichte von",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 420.922,
        "x1": 178.658,
        "bottom": 427.922
      },
      "reading_order": 66,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0067",
      "text": "ierungsmittel spülen.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 426.333,
        "x1": 286.736,
        "bottom": 433.333
      },
      "reading_order": 67,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0068",
      "text": "Rohwellenpumpen. Das auf dem Datenblatt angegebene Ge-",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 429.322,
        "x1": 185.23,
        "bottom": 436.322
      },
      "reading_order": 68,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0069",
      "text": "Für die Förderung von Ölen, Kohlenwasserstoffen,",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 434.733,
        "x1": 361.117,
        "bottom": 441.733
      },
      "reading_order": 69,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0070",
      "text": "wicht wird durch Antriebselemente und Grundplatten erhöht.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 437.721,
        "x1": 185.503,
        "bottom": 444.721
      },
      "reading_order": 70,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0071",
      "text": "Lösungsmitteln usw. sind Laufräder aus Nitril und",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 443.134,
        "x1": 360.404,
        "bottom": 450.134
      },
      "reading_order": 71,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0072",
      "text": "d. Die Anschlüsse müssen so ausgelegt sein, dass sie die korrekte",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 449.001,
        "x1": 188.8,
        "bottom": 456.001
      },
      "reading_order": 72,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0073",
      "text": "Viton in Industriequalität erhältlich. Bitte wenden",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 451.534,
        "x1": 360.627,
        "bottom": 458.534
      },
      "reading_order": 73,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0074",
      "text": "Ausrichtung und Verbindung für den Verwendungszweck",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 457.401,
        "x1": 175.263,
        "bottom": 464.401
      },
      "reading_order": 74,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0075",
      "text": "Sie sich dazu an den Hersteller oder Ihren Händler",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 459.933,
        "x1": 361.642,
        "bottom": 466.933
      },
      "reading_order": 75,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0076",
      "text": "bieten.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 465.802,
        "x1": 53.283,
        "bottom": 472.802
      },
      "reading_order": 76,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0077",
      "text": "vor Ort. Verwenden Sie Jabsco-Pumpen niemals für",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 468.333,
        "x1": 364.121,
        "bottom": 475.333
      },
      "reading_order": 77,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0078",
      "text": "Benzin, sonstige Erdölprodukte oder irgendwelche",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 476.733,
        "x1": 362.832,
        "bottom": 483.733
      },
      "reading_order": 78,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0079",
      "text": "ACHTUNG",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.68,
        "top": 483.969,
        "x1": 85.023,
        "bottom": 490.969
      },
      "reading_order": 79,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0080",
      "text": "Stoffe mit einem Flammpunkt unter 37 °C – dies",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 485.134,
        "x1": 356.177,
        "bottom": 492.134
      },
      "reading_order": 80,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0081",
      "text": "Schweres Heben und andere schwere Tätigkeiten",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.68,
        "top": 492.369,
        "x1": 177.953,
        "bottom": 499.369
      },
      "reading_order": 81,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0082",
      "text": "kann zur Explosion führen und ist lebensgefährlich!",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 493.534,
        "x1": 366.081,
        "bottom": 500.534
      },
      "reading_order": 82,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0083",
      "text": "dürfen nur von entsprechend geschultem Personal",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.68,
        "top": 500.769,
        "x1": 182.881,
        "bottom": 507.769
      },
      "reading_order": 83,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0084",
      "text": "durchgeführt werden.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 49.68,
        "top": 509.169,
        "x1": 107.345,
        "bottom": 516.169
      },
      "reading_order": 84,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0085",
      "text": "2.02 Aufstellung und Ausrichtung",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 511.856,
        "x1": 321.505,
        "bottom": 518.856
      },
      "reading_order": 85,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0086",
      "text": "Die Pumpe sollte wie folgt aufgestellt werden:",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 523.136,
        "x1": 319.796,
        "bottom": 530.136
      },
      "reading_order": 86,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0087",
      "text": "• So nah an der Flüssigkeitsquelle wie möglich und so niedrig",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 536.036,
        "x1": 363.076,
        "bottom": 543.036
      },
      "reading_order": 87,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0088",
      "text": "2. MONTAGE",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 536.143,
        "x1": 90.7,
        "bottom": 546.143
      },
      "reading_order": 88,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0089",
      "text": "wie möglich, um den für die Pumpe verfügbaren Nettoeinlass-",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 216.0,
        "top": 544.436,
        "x1": 367.981,
        "bottom": 551.436
      },
      "reading_order": 89,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0090",
      "text": "Bei Pumpen mit flexiblem Laufrad müssen Sie sorgfältig auf die",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 549.691,
        "x1": 182.655,
        "bottom": 556.691
      },
      "reading_order": 90,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0091",
      "text": "druck zu maximieren.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 216.0,
        "top": 552.836,
        "x1": 268.975,
        "bottom": 559.836
      },
      "reading_order": 91,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0092",
      "text": "korrekte Montage sowie auf bestimmte Einschränkungen hinsicht-",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 558.091,
        "x1": 189.0,
        "bottom": 565.091
      },
      "reading_order": 92,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0093",
      "text": "• In einem freien Bereich, der den Zugang rund um die Pumpe",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 564.116,
        "x1": 365.243,
        "bottom": 571.116
      },
      "reading_order": 93,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0094",
      "text": "lich der Betriebsbedingungen der Pumpe achten. So ermöglichen",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 566.491,
        "x1": 187.486,
        "bottom": 573.491
      },
      "reading_order": 94,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0095",
      "text": "und den Antrieb ermöglicht, um die Wartung zu erleichtern.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 216.0,
        "top": 572.516,
        "x1": 362.438,
        "bottom": 579.516
      },
      "reading_order": 95,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0096",
      "text": "Sie eine lange Lebensdauer und einen störungsfreien Betrieb.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 574.891,
        "x1": 178.511,
        "bottom": 581.891
      },
      "reading_order": 96,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0020:b0097",
      "text": "20",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 194.34,
        "top": 587.476,
        "x1": 201.66,
        "bottom": 593.476
      },
      "reading_order": 97,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    }
  ],
  "tables": [],
  "warnings": []
}
